    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BRANT & CO Property Consultants are delighted to present 36 South Bank, Swords to the market, a bright and spacious B RATED three-bedroom, three-bathroom terraced home ideally located within this popular and established residential development.\r\n\r\nOffering generous and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, No. 36 benefits from off-street driveway parking to the front and a private south-facing rear garden, making this an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families or those looking to move within the Swords area.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with guest WC, leading through to a spacious living room featuring attractive timber-style flooring, decorative coving and a feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nTo the rear is a particularly generous open-plan kitchen, dining and family area, creating a bright and versatile everyday living space. The fitted kitchen provides an excellent range of wall and floor units together with ample worktop and storage space. Large sliding patio doors and additional glazing overlook and provide direct access to the south-facing rear garden, allowing plenty of natural light into the room.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there are three bedrooms, including a particularly spacious main bedroom with an excellent range of fitted wardrobes and a private en-suite shower room. Two further bedrooms and a family bathroom complete the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe property is presented in good, clean condition while also offering an excellent opportunity for a new owner to modernise and personalise the home over time to their own taste.\r\n\r\nThe location is superb. Swords Village and Pavilions Shopping Centre are within easy reach, offering an extensive range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and leisure facilities. Dublin Airport is just a short drive away, while the M1 and M50 provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and the wider Dublin area. The property is also well served by public transport links.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment through Brant & Co Property Consultants."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Property Features:\r\n\r\nB RATED PROPERTY\r\nSpacious three-bedroom terraced home\r\nThree bathrooms – guest WC, en-suite and family bathroom\r\nLarge main bedroom with fitted wardrobes\r\nEn-suite shower room\r\nGenerous living room with feature fireplace\r\nOpen-plan kitchen/dining/family area\r\nExcellent natural light throughout\r\nPrivate south-facing rear garden\r\nOff-street driveway parking\r\nGas-fired central heating\r\nExcellent opportunity to modernise and personalise\r\nConvenient to Swords Village\r\nClose to Pavilions Shopping Centre\r\nEasy access to Dublin Airport, M1 and M50\r\nExcellent transport links to Dublin City Centre\r\nPopular and mature residential location"
      },
